.TH GANDER 1 "2025-08-16" "gander 0.5.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
gander \- render Markdown locally, optionally share it on gander.md
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B gander
.RI [ options ]
.IR file.md
.sp
.B gander signup
.RB [ \-email \ Iemail\fR]
.sp
.B gander share
.RB [ \-watch ]
.IR file.md
.sp
.B gander remove
.RB [ \-all | "\-pick "\fIshort_id\fR ]
.RB [ \-yes ]
.RB [ \-non\-interactive ]
.IR target
.sp
.B gander list
.sp
.B gander manage
.sp
.B gander auth
.IR api_token
.sp
.B gander completion
.RB { bash | zsh }
.sp
.B gander \-\-upgrade
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B gander
converts a Markdown file to HTML and opens the result in the default web
browser.
If run with
.BR \-\-watch ","
the preview live\-reloadss in place on save.
After registering with
.B gander signup
the
.BR share ","
.BR remove ","
.B list ","
.B manage ,
and
.B auth
subcommands upload Markdown to
.RI \(la https://gander.md \(ra
("gander.md") and return short share links.
.SH OPTIONS
These flags apply to the default
.I gander
.BR file " mode."
.TP
.BI \-outfile " string"
Write the rendered HTML to
.I string
instead of opening it in the browser.
.TP
.BR \-watch ", " \-\-watch
Render once, then re\-render and hot\-swap the preview in the browser each
time the file changes.
May not be combined with
.BR \-outfile .
.TP
.BR \-upgrade ", " \-\-upgrade
Download and install the latest release, then exit.
.TP
.BR \-\-help ", " \-h
Print help and exit.
.SH COMMANDS
.SS "Signup"
.TP
.B signup
Open the signup form in your browser, then save the resulting API token
in
.IR ~/.gander .
The token is required for the other gander.md commands.
.sp
.RS
.TP
.BI "\-email " email
The address to register. Required.
.RE
.SS "Share"
.TP
.B share
Upload
.IR file.md
to gander.md, print the share link, and open it in the browser.
.sp
.RS
.TP
.B \-watch
Continuously push local changes to the remote share until interrupted.
.RE
.SS "Remove"
.TP
.B remove
Delete a share previously created by
.BR share .
The argument may be a local file path, an 8\-character
.IR short_id ,
or a
.I https://gander.md/s/<short_id>
URL.
.sp
.RS
.TP
.B \-all
Remove every share matching the argument.
.TP
.BI "\-pick " short_id
When the argument matches more than one share, remove the one with the
given
.IR short_id .
.TP
.B \-yes
Skip the per\-share confirmation prompt.
.TP
.B \-non\-interactive
Refuse to prompt; require
.B \-all
or
.B \-pick
when the argument is ambiguous.
.RE
.SS "List"
.TP
.B list
Print a table of every share in the user's gander.md account (short id,
file, watch flag, last update, URL).
.SS "Manage"
.TP
.B manage
Open the gander.md dashboard in your browser. Requires an existing API
token (sign up first). The dashboard shows your shares, rotates your API
token, and lets you attach a password to log in via the web.
.SS "Auth"
.TP
.B auth
Validate and install a new API token, e.g. one you rotated in the
dashboard. Requires an existing API token (sign up first); the command
checks the new token against
.B /api/me
before overwriting
.IR ~/.gander .
Email and
.B api_url
are preserved.
.SS "Completion"
.TP
.B completion
Print a shell completion script to standard output.
Takes a single argument naming the shell. Supported:
.RB \(lq bash \(rq
and
.RB \(lq zsh \(rq.
.SS "Self\-update"
.TP
.BR \-\-upgrade
Download the latest release binary for the current platform, verify its
checksum, atomically replace the running binary, and exit.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.gander
JSON configuration file. Holds the API token (chmod 600), API endpoint,
default flags, and the local map of file path \(-> short id.
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
Success.
.TP
.B 1
An error occurred (file not found, network failure, ambiguous share,
user rejected a prompt, etc.).
.SH EXAMPLES
Render a local file and open the preview:
.PP
.RS
.nf
gander README.md
.fi
.RE
.PP
Live\-reload the preview while writing:
.PP
.RS
.nf
gander \-watch README.md
.fi
.RE
.PP
Push the same file to gander.md and open the share link:
.PP
.RS
.nf
gander share README.md
.fi
.RE
.PP
Remove a share by short id:
.PP
.RS
.nf
gander remove aBcD1234
.fi
.RE
.SH "SEE ALSO"
Project home page:
.RI \(la https://github.com/gandermd/gander-cli \(ra.
.SH AUTHORS
.B gander
is developed at
.RI \(la https://gander.md \(ra.
